English translation, for reference only (the Spanish text prevails):

Copyright (c) 2026 Poder Judicial del Estado de Chihuahua.
All rights reserved.

This repository publishes a demo of the statistics dashboard of the Poder
Judicial del Estado de Chihuahua. You may view the code and use the online
demo. Any other use, copying, modification, distribution or publication of
the code, in whole or in part, requires prior written permission from the
Poder Judicial del Estado de Chihuahua. This does not limit what GitHub's
Terms of Service allow for public repositories within GitHub, such as
viewing and forking them.

The demo contains no real data. The sample file
samples/BASE_DEMO_FICTICIA.xlsx holds randomly generated fictitious data
that doesn't reflect real court activity.

The name, the shield and the other distinctive signs of the Poder Judicial
del Estado de Chihuahua are not licensed with this software.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Neither the
Poder Judicial del Estado de Chihuahua nor the authors are liable for any
damages arising from its use.

The third-party libraries used by the page (Tailwind CSS, Chart.js,
chartjs-plugin-datalabels, SheetJS and Font Awesome) are loaded from CDNs
and remain under their own licenses.
